WEBVTT

00:10.710 --> 00:12.070
Child of Contract...?

00:12.070 --> 00:13.270
A Child of Contract...

00:13.270 --> 00:15.830
A Child of Contract has finally appeared...

00:20.580 --> 00:24.540
We'll protect him until he rises to the throne.

00:26.790 --> 00:30.060
We are the members of the revolution seeking independence for Nil Kamui.

00:30.060 --> 00:33.600
Please, use us to your will, Child of Contract.

00:33.600 --> 00:35.560
Fugaku...

00:35.560 --> 00:38.230
Why did you make me wear the Ryugatou?

00:38.230 --> 00:41.200
You knew Kouran would go through the market.

00:41.200 --> 00:42.640
Why...?

00:42.640 --> 00:45.410
I did not expect this result.

00:45.410 --> 00:48.410
But... I have heard your will to rise as king, and--

00:48.410 --> 00:52.080
Why did Mashiro have to die?!

00:52.080 --> 00:54.050
You're the one who killed her!

00:54.050 --> 00:56.050
He's no Child of Contract!

00:56.050 --> 00:58.390
He's... He's just a murderer!

00:58.390 --> 01:00.720
He killed my sister, Mashiro!

01:02.060 --> 01:04.890
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

01:04.890 --> 01:06.730
It's a small country.

01:06.730 --> 01:11.430
The covetous, great ancient country of Kouran conducted a sudden invasion

01:11.430 --> 01:14.300
and plundered a third of the land.

01:14.300 --> 01:17.270
Our ally, the great country to the east, D'natia,

01:17.270 --> 01:21.310
defended settlements where they had their bases, then kept silent.

01:21.310 --> 01:24.150
The two great countries quickly carved away Nil Kamui's lands

01:24.150 --> 01:27.620
like meat from a sacrificial swine.

01:27.620 --> 01:33.460
Our guardian deity, Red Dragon, didn't protect the land.

01:33.460 --> 01:36.090
Imperial Era 3015, September...

01:36.090 --> 01:40.260
Our country was no longer ours.

01:40.260 --> 01:45.030
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

01:45.030 --> 01:49.470
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

01:49.470 --> 01:51.600
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

02:02.380 --> 02:11.730
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

02:11.730 --> 02:12.730
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

02:12.730 --> 02:14.830
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:14.830 --> 02:17.900
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:17.900 --> 02:20.140
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:20.140 --> 02:22.340
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:22.340 --> 02:26.570
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

02:26.570 --> 02:32.810
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

02:32.810 --> 02:38.320
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:38.320 --> 02:43.390
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

02:43.390 --> 02:49.060
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

02:49.060 --> 02:54.670
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

02:54.670 --> 02:58.710
<i>The ending world</i>

02:58.710 --> 03:03.580
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

03:11.090 --> 03:12.950
"Nil Kamui \ Shuka revolution army quarter"

03:19.190 --> 03:22.700
I-I'm not afraid of any Bound One.

03:22.700 --> 03:27.570
Back in the old days, the likes of you wouldn't even be able to speak with us!

03:27.570 --> 03:30.370
Are you acquainted with Mashiro?

03:30.370 --> 03:33.240
You know my sister, Mashiro...?

03:33.240 --> 03:34.910
No...

03:34.910 --> 03:39.210
She's not actually my real sister, but I really...

03:39.210 --> 03:42.120
...liked her?

03:42.120 --> 03:45.090
That's not it...

03:57.330 --> 03:59.270
How marvelous...

03:59.270 --> 04:03.910
My lord's authority makes even the most mindless of beasts kneel.

04:03.910 --> 04:07.080
I thought this place to be a petty island of little value,

04:07.080 --> 04:10.580
but this place is quite... interesting.

04:10.580 --> 04:13.250
Mashiro was a shrine maiden of the Child of Contract?

04:13.250 --> 04:14.950
That's what I heard.

04:14.950 --> 04:17.850
That means Ibuki was at the castle, too.

04:17.850 --> 04:20.520
So why'd he kill Mashiro, then?!

04:20.520 --> 04:24.620
Don't the shrine maidens serve the
Imperials who came from the line of kings?

04:26.430 --> 04:28.290
Mashiro told me...

04:29.360 --> 04:32.530
Long, long ago, Red Dragon made a promise.

04:32.530 --> 04:36.270
If the Child of Contract, the king, made a suitable offering,

04:36.270 --> 04:38.770
Red Dragon would lend its blade in return.

04:38.770 --> 04:40.480
Offering?

04:40.480 --> 04:43.040
A bonded soul.

04:43.040 --> 04:45.680
There are a number of interpretations of this,

04:45.680 --> 04:49.380
but I think it means to offer everything to the king.

04:50.790 --> 04:53.450
An equivalent exchange of the life of someone precious

04:53.450 --> 04:56.460
for the life of one who may get in the way...

04:56.460 --> 04:59.560
What an ingenious scheme.

04:59.560 --> 05:04.730
So, you're telling me that Mashiro offered her soul to Ibuki by her own accord?

05:04.730 --> 05:08.670
Mashiro eagerly awaited the arrival of such a day.

05:08.670 --> 05:09.670
But...!

05:09.670 --> 05:12.510
But that's wrong...

05:12.510 --> 05:18.850
Kai, you heard how Red Dragon went mad and destroyed villages around the area, right?

05:18.850 --> 05:21.850
Are you saying that this is all because Red Dragon went mad?

05:21.850 --> 05:23.990
Kai...

05:23.990 --> 05:29.250
What, so you weren't responsible for killing
Mashiro because Red Dragon is insane?!

05:30.990 --> 05:32.930
Lord Ibuki.

05:32.930 --> 05:34.490
There you are.

05:36.100 --> 05:41.870
"Nil Kamui \ Shuka revolution army quarter"

05:36.330 --> 05:39.700
While this country went without a king, the council...

05:39.700 --> 05:45.110
...or should I say, the provisional government, along with D'natia and Kouran, usurped us.

05:45.110 --> 05:48.580
Now is the time for us to regain this country.

05:48.580 --> 05:52.080
Did I really become a Child of Contract?

05:52.080 --> 05:55.080
The power you exhibited to defeat Kouran's general

05:55.080 --> 05:58.250
is no doubt the power of Red Dragon.

05:58.250 --> 06:02.380
We will move ourselves somewhere safe tonight.

06:03.930 --> 06:07.630
Kouran's reinforcements should arrive by daybreak.

06:07.630 --> 06:09.100
We'll leave at once.

06:09.100 --> 06:12.700
Oh, c'mon. That's not going to help me.

06:12.700 --> 06:14.140
Who are you?

06:14.140 --> 06:17.410
Hey there! We pretty much came from D'natia.

06:17.410 --> 06:19.570
What do you mean "pretty much"?

06:19.570 --> 06:22.040
You're that...

06:23.980 --> 06:25.550
D'natia?!

06:25.550 --> 06:27.750
You've got some nerve coming here now!

06:27.750 --> 06:29.980
Sir Black Dragon Knight...

06:29.980 --> 06:35.390
Yup, I'm Sweallow Clazzvali of the Black Dragon Knights.

06:36.560 --> 06:38.430
My name is Meryl Sherbet.

06:38.430 --> 06:41.430
I am an attendant to Sir Sweallow.

06:41.430 --> 06:43.800
Black Dragon Knight...

06:43.800 --> 06:45.730
A mighty soldier said to have received

06:45.730 --> 06:49.440
the power of D'natia's guardian deity, Black Dragon...

06:49.440 --> 06:53.440
I heard there are only thirty like him out of D'natia's force of 300,000.

06:53.440 --> 06:55.910
I can't believe one of them...

06:55.910 --> 06:58.480
Hm? "One of them" what?

06:58.480 --> 07:00.280
Has the look of an idiot.

07:00.280 --> 07:03.420
Whoa... That's gonna hurt me bad, Meryl.

07:03.420 --> 07:06.850
So... What is a great person like you doing here?

07:06.850 --> 07:09.820
Come now, you're the great one, Ibuki.

07:09.820 --> 07:12.030
You're this country's runner-up for king.

07:12.030 --> 07:14.160
By request of Nil Kamui's council,

07:14.160 --> 07:18.600
we would like to bring you on as a member of the expedition for Red Dragon...

07:18.600 --> 07:20.170
...or at least that's what I heard.

07:20.170 --> 07:23.640
I was selected to be a member of the expedition, too.

07:23.640 --> 07:26.970
Red Dragon... expedition?

07:28.010 --> 07:30.980
"Nil Kamui \ Shuka prison"

07:34.020 --> 07:36.320
I can't believe you called me at this hour...

07:36.320 --> 07:39.490
I am truly sorry for bringing you here.

07:39.490 --> 07:43.720
But there was no way we could let him out of here...

07:46.530 --> 07:49.660
Welcome to this filthy prison.

07:51.530 --> 07:55.070
It looks like the current rulers of Nil Kamui are here.

07:55.070 --> 07:57.140
I didn't notice you here...

07:57.140 --> 08:01.080
Agito... Kouran's forces were attacked by the revolutionary army.

08:01.080 --> 08:03.540
Ah, in town, right?

08:03.540 --> 08:05.580
Are you the one who gave the order?

08:05.580 --> 08:06.850
Listen carefully...

08:06.850 --> 08:10.990
We need to confirm the rumor of Red Dragon going mad.

08:10.990 --> 08:16.060
But moving a country's force will bring about unwanted confusion.

08:16.060 --> 08:19.060
Hence, Kouran...

08:19.060 --> 08:20.600
...D'natia...

08:20.600 --> 08:22.660
...and the rebel army...

08:22.660 --> 08:25.900
Correction... "The revolutionary army."

08:25.900 --> 08:30.510
The three countries are to send their elite to form the expedition for Red Dragon.

08:30.510 --> 08:33.010
That was our agreement.

08:33.010 --> 08:38.850
In order to bring Ibuki aboard the expedition, he needed to have his eyes opened a bit.

08:38.850 --> 08:42.870
Are you telling me that Kouran and the revolutionary army were sacrificed for that?

08:44.120 --> 08:49.360
That's fine... I'll treat this as if it was an unfortunate accident.

08:49.360 --> 08:53.430
But I won't let you do such a thing again

08:53.430 --> 08:56.230
until after the combined expedition finds Red Dragon...

08:58.630 --> 09:00.300
"Shuka outskirts \ Kouran force's camp site"

08:58.700 --> 09:00.870
Unfortunate accident?!

09:00.870 --> 09:03.370
I could care less about the combined expedition!

09:03.370 --> 09:05.970
Nil Kamui's rebels are the ones who caused the commotion!

09:05.970 --> 09:08.940
When are the reinforcements going to arrive?!

09:08.940 --> 09:10.280
Return at once...

09:10.280 --> 09:12.550
There's no way I can heed such an order!

09:12.550 --> 09:15.450
I will get back the stolen Dragon Eye!

09:16.750 --> 09:18.240
Lady Kohkaku.

09:19.390 --> 09:23.760
Are you certain that this "Child of Contract" was the one who killed Kohretsu?

09:23.760 --> 09:27.560
Yes, everyone is saying that it was by the power of Red Dragon.

09:27.560 --> 09:30.800
Why would one from the king's lineage reside at an orphanage?

09:30.800 --> 09:35.640
It is true. After all, he came to our stall a number of times to make purchases.

09:35.640 --> 09:37.910
I thank you for your information.

09:37.910 --> 09:41.080
Now, please return to us our child whom you have summoned!

09:41.080 --> 09:42.910
Ah, I see.

09:42.910 --> 09:46.810
That handsome-looking boy was your son, was he?

09:46.810 --> 09:48.750
But you're too late...

09:48.750 --> 09:49.920
What?

09:49.920 --> 09:54.660
A special spell of the Kouran allows one to burn life onto a seal.

09:54.660 --> 09:59.990
Your son's life is now a part of me, to protect me from harm...

10:01.930 --> 10:03.990
Mom...

10:06.270 --> 10:13.980
And so we really need your power to find Red Dragon, Ibuki.

10:13.980 --> 10:17.180
D'natia and Kouran, who are in conflict over dominion of this island,

10:17.180 --> 10:19.980
forming a combined expedition in goodwill?

10:19.980 --> 10:21.650
That's hard to believe.

10:21.650 --> 10:25.720
Besides us, I heard that there is a participant from the revolutionary army as well.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.990
That is news to me.

10:26.990 --> 10:29.790
In the first place, where is
Kouran's representative?

10:29.790 --> 10:33.890
We're supposed to meet up somewhere in this town, but I haven't met the person yet.

10:33.890 --> 10:36.200
They're supposed to have something like this on them...

10:36.200 --> 10:37.730
Huh? Wait a minute.

10:37.730 --> 10:42.400
Unlike Kouran, D'natia and
Nil Kamui have always been allies.

10:42.400 --> 10:44.470
We're like friends... Right?

10:44.470 --> 10:49.840
It seems you've forgotten, so make sure this gets through that thick skull of yours.

10:49.840 --> 10:53.550
D'natia was allied with this island's royal family,

10:53.550 --> 10:56.180
but when Kouran's forces invaded Nil Kamui,

10:56.180 --> 11:00.190
our country defended only the towns where our military bases were stationed.

11:00.190 --> 11:03.090
Huh? Then what happened to the king?

11:03.090 --> 11:07.030
The king was assassinated during the turmoil with Kouran during the Seven Year War,

11:07.030 --> 11:11.830
and as a result, Nil Kamui accepted a treaty which signified complete surrender.

11:11.830 --> 11:15.440
Whoa... That was a terrible move by our country.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.870
Excuse me...

11:16.870 --> 11:18.870
...but I...

11:18.870 --> 11:20.340
The Kouran force...

11:20.340 --> 11:23.400
The Kouran force is laying siege to the town!

11:24.510 --> 11:26.080
So, their reinforcements arrived already.

11:26.080 --> 11:28.850
No, it's actually the remnant force from earlier today.

11:28.850 --> 11:32.840
If that's all there is, we can fight them on our own!

11:33.850 --> 11:35.060
Please wait!

11:35.060 --> 11:37.250
There are children in the town!

11:38.960 --> 11:41.260
I'm assuming it's futile to try to stop you...

11:41.260 --> 11:44.930
You know, you really are the best attendant I could have, Meryl.

11:50.070 --> 11:52.110
Mashiro...

11:52.110 --> 11:55.710
I said horrible things to Ibuki.

11:55.710 --> 11:57.200
But...

12:06.220 --> 12:10.290
Let the flames dance until they reach the eyes of this "Child of Contract!"

12:10.290 --> 12:12.990
Cry until they reach that one's ears!

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
"Bound One \ A slave whose body has been

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
linked to that of a monster through a ritual

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
performed during childhood. Connected by

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
a special vine like an umbilical cord, the slave

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
and monster share their lives, thus allowing

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
the Bound One to control powerful monsters,

12:14.800 --> 12:18.560
making them a human weapon of sorts."

12:23.100 --> 12:24.410
You're unfit for this.

12:24.410 --> 12:26.140
Let me go! Who are you?!

12:26.140 --> 12:28.310
Ibuki...

12:28.310 --> 12:34.820
Yes... I hear he's able to convert the souls of those precious to him into power.

12:34.820 --> 12:37.920
There must be something you can do, too...

12:37.920 --> 12:40.410
My... soul?

12:46.160 --> 12:47.930
We'll go all out on them!

12:47.930 --> 12:49.500
Open the gates!

12:49.500 --> 12:52.670
Nah, if you open the gates, everyone will die.

12:52.670 --> 12:54.800
What's this about, Black Dragon Knight?

12:54.800 --> 12:58.670
Now, now. I think this is about the only way to gain your trust.

12:58.670 --> 13:02.140
Besides, I don't want to see any children get killed...

13:02.140 --> 13:03.770
Right, Meryl?

13:08.820 --> 13:11.390
Finally... but only one of them?

13:11.390 --> 13:14.050
Hm? He's not one of the rebels.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.220
Die!

13:17.220 --> 13:18.720
Oh, well...

13:29.970 --> 13:33.040
My debt to Meryl's going to increase again.

13:33.040 --> 13:35.310
What's with that move?!

13:35.310 --> 13:37.800
Who cares? Charge!

13:39.550 --> 13:41.410
Guess it can't be helped...

13:58.430 --> 14:01.370
What's with his battle style?

14:01.370 --> 14:05.040
Any instrument he wields falls apart.

14:05.040 --> 14:08.100
That's the curse he was born with.

14:12.110 --> 14:14.250
But the moment it falls apart...

14:14.250 --> 14:17.620
...that instrument is capable of exerting all of its power.

14:21.860 --> 14:23.360
Now then...

14:23.360 --> 14:26.560
I wonder how much he's planning to waste on this battle.

14:33.430 --> 14:35.400
That direction...

14:35.400 --> 14:36.870
Could it be...?!

14:36.870 --> 14:38.110
Where are you going?

14:38.110 --> 14:41.610
Fugaku asked for you to stay here.

14:41.610 --> 14:43.880
Eykha, was it?

14:43.880 --> 14:44.880
Please...

14:44.880 --> 14:46.450
Please?

14:46.450 --> 14:48.620
You're saying that to me, a Bound One?

14:48.620 --> 14:50.120
Please...

14:50.120 --> 14:52.250
...let me ride on your friend's back.

14:55.920 --> 14:57.410
Sure.

15:01.060 --> 15:02.230
I knew it!

15:02.230 --> 15:03.930
Could everyone still be inside?

15:03.930 --> 15:06.730
I'll distract her, so you go on in.

15:14.840 --> 15:17.950
Is anyone around...?!

15:17.950 --> 15:21.120
--Ibuki!
--Ibuki!

15:21.120 --> 15:24.590
Thank goodness! It'll be all right.

15:24.590 --> 15:26.590
You came back to save them?

15:26.590 --> 15:30.590
Yes... You protected them, didn't you, Kai?

15:30.590 --> 15:32.150
Thank you.

15:46.810 --> 15:48.780
Bite it to pieces, Val!

15:48.780 --> 15:51.470
I hold more than one life!

16:00.450 --> 16:01.950
Eykha!

16:03.960 --> 16:07.230
This isn't good...
At this rate, we'll all be killed!

16:07.230 --> 16:09.130
We need to defeat her.

16:13.400 --> 16:16.340
I'll use that power once more...

16:16.340 --> 16:17.970
Answer me...

16:17.970 --> 16:19.460
...Red Dragon!

16:31.990 --> 16:33.990
Imperial...

16:33.990 --> 16:37.320
So, you desire the flames I possess?

16:37.320 --> 16:39.760
The contract was enacted.

16:39.760 --> 16:42.330
You forced the offering from me.

16:42.330 --> 16:45.600
A person that was precious to me...!

16:45.600 --> 16:46.830
Indeed.

16:46.830 --> 16:50.170
If so, bring about that flame once more and get rid of the enemy!

16:50.170 --> 16:55.580
If that is what you desire, then offer me an equivalent.

16:55.580 --> 16:58.210
I already paid for that...!

16:58.210 --> 16:59.280
I•••

16:59.280 --> 17:05.750
One life, one soul... Scales are impartial.

17:05.750 --> 17:10.190
One life, one soul?

17:10.190 --> 17:11.560
What's with that nonsense?!

17:11.560 --> 17:13.030
Ibuki...

17:13.030 --> 17:14.730
It's my turn now!

17:14.730 --> 17:16.700
What are you saying, Kai?!

17:16.700 --> 17:19.700
Red Dragon seeks the soul of someone you're bonded to, right?

17:19.700 --> 17:23.260
Couldn't that also mean someone who's your friend, Ibuki?

17:24.640 --> 17:25.710
What are you...?

17:25.710 --> 17:28.780
Kill me, just like you did Mashiro!

17:28.780 --> 17:31.310
Then go and beat that monster!

17:31.310 --> 17:34.620
Stop it! Please... stop!

17:34.620 --> 17:36.780
I killed Mashiro with my own hands.

17:36.780 --> 17:39.120
I won't let another...

17:39.120 --> 17:40.550
You're a king, right?!

17:40.550 --> 17:41.990
You're going to become a king, right?!

17:41.990 --> 17:44.750
Are you going to let all of them die in front of you?!

17:46.230 --> 17:48.000
No... I can't...

17:48.000 --> 17:52.400
I'm not good enough? Am I not your friend anymore, Ibuki?!

17:52.400 --> 17:53.400
Kai.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.930
You're my...

17:59.410 --> 18:00.670
Ibuki!

18:00.670 --> 18:04.850
I can't believe you can use such a terrifying move with that cute face of yours.

18:04.850 --> 18:07.080
Where is the Dragon Eye?

18:07.080 --> 18:08.570
There it is!

18:12.490 --> 18:14.250
Out of my way!

18:18.860 --> 18:20.790
Kai...! Kai!

18:20.790 --> 18:23.300
The equivalent has been received.

18:23.300 --> 18:25.470
Red Dragon! What are you saying?!

18:25.470 --> 18:27.500
I didn't kill Kai!

18:27.500 --> 18:31.670
He has the birthright to be king, yet could not stop what occurred in front of his eyes.

18:31.670 --> 18:35.780
That is called abandonment, and is akin to murder.

18:35.780 --> 18:38.650
Ah... So that's how a dragon sees it.

18:38.650 --> 18:42.650
Souls hold that much weight, and thus are sweet.

18:42.650 --> 18:45.890
Indeed, my lord...

18:45.890 --> 18:47.620
Thank goodness...

18:47.620 --> 18:48.990
Kai...

18:48.990 --> 18:51.790
Red Dragon acknowledged...

18:51.790 --> 18:54.960
...that I'm still your friend, Ibuki...

18:56.300 --> 18:59.970
I said a lot of horrible things to you... Sorry...

18:59.970 --> 19:03.300
I was... jealous...

19:03.300 --> 19:06.740
...of you and sis...

19:06.740 --> 19:09.070
...Mashiro...

19:11.210 --> 19:15.980
Do as you desire, Imperial.

19:15.980 --> 19:18.520
I couldn't protect him...

19:18.520 --> 19:21.860
That's the same as killing him...

19:21.860 --> 19:26.360
That's what you want to say, isn't it, Red Dragon...?

19:26.360 --> 19:28.730
He's fused with the Dragon Eye?

19:28.730 --> 19:31.000
Steel Form, release!

19:31.000 --> 19:33.500
I'll gouge the Dragon Eye from you!

19:33.500 --> 19:35.500
Young boy, if you're going to curse anything,

19:35.500 --> 19:38.600
curse your misfortune in being born on this island of savages!

20:04.970 --> 20:08.030
In the name of the Child of
Contract and Red Dragon...

20:10.540 --> 20:12.060
...perish!

20:37.330 --> 20:39.170
Are you sure about this?

20:39.170 --> 20:45.440
Yes... I'll join your combined expedition.

20:45.440 --> 20:49.440
If I stay here, I'll lose more of those precious to me...

20:49.440 --> 20:50.580
What?

20:50.580 --> 20:53.750
I want to meet Red Dragon.

20:53.750 --> 20:58.250
And I want to return this power.

20:58.250 --> 21:00.590
No... This curse!

21:02.360 --> 21:03.520
Got it.

21:03.520 --> 21:04.690
Let's go, then.

21:04.690 --> 21:08.490
Fugaku, please take care of the children.

21:18.670 --> 21:20.160
Ibuki!

21:28.980 --> 21:30.520
You're...?

21:30.520 --> 21:32.790
Kouran's representative.

21:32.790 --> 21:34.280
She's...

21:38.460 --> 21:40.890
So we finally meet, Ibuki.

21:40.890 --> 21:44.830
Will you be my friend?

21:45.900 --> 21:46.370
"Act 2"

21:47.330 --> 21:50.630
"Act 2 \ Antinomy"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.930 --> 23:30.170
Act 3: "Three as One."

23:26.930 --> 23:27.430
"Act 3"

23:30.170 --> 23:36.140
The motive behind the three countries seeking the dragon dyes Ibuki's life in black.

23:36.140 --> 23:40.410
And now, the final player takes a seat at the table.
